DG ⟂ AC [04]

 * Auxiliary Constructions:
: Points


 * Proof steps:
001. F,B,A are collinear [01] & A,C,G are collinear [03] & DG ⟂ AC [04] & DF ⟂ AB [02] ⇒  ∠AFD = ∠AGD [05]
002. ∠AFD = ∠AGD [05] ⇒  A,G,D,F are concyclic [06]
003. A,G,D,F are concyclic [06] ⇒  ∠AGF = ∠ADF [07]
004. ∠BAE = ∠DAC [00] & ∠AGF = ∠ADF [07] & A,C,G are collinear [03] ⇒  ∠DFG = ∠BAE [08]
005. ∠DFG = ∠BAE [08] & DF ⟂ AB [02] ⇒  AE ⟂ FG
